        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n4\n0011\n6\n111000",
        "output": "10\n17",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1: SSS is already sorted. So all its substrings are good.\nTest Case 2: Some of the substrings of SSS which are good are: 000000000, 111011101110, 100100100, 111111111."
